        "Cost": 52630000,
        "Details": "Designed to rule as the leader of a pack, the King Crab Royal 12 version of the King crab features a large number of long-range rockets, dual pairs of ballistic hardpoints that are equipped with a total of four predator cannons, and also a ballistic seige computer borrowed from the Annihilator and a battle-coordination coms system computer borrowed from the Cyclops, making it a very powerful command battlemech to lead and coordinate other battlemechs on the battlefield at 120 tons.  With elite jump-jets, that magically lighten overall tonnage for more support for armor and equipment, it has a large amount of armor.  That, and it's internal structure is reinforced and superior to that of any battlemech of only 100 tons and lighter, including the 0000 model.",
